{"4238920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Paws Coven", "steam_appid": 4238920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/dcccfc92b33da1d47cc1ae08b13d4bde.avif?t=1776975450\" width=1200 height=120 /></span>Co-op horror. Four players - 3v1. In 'Paws Coven', three players take on the role of occult cats. They must collect dark mana, tear off the wallpaper, summon monsters from other worlds, and perform rituals. They are opposed by one human who, among the many cats on the map, must identify the three impostors and catch each of them before they can perform 5 rituals or drain him of his sanity.<br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/7dadb5a25c95dcd32d23af50ca6440b4.poster.avif?t=1776975450\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/7dadb5a25c95dcd32d23af50ca6440b4.webm?t=1776975450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/7dadb5a25c95dcd32d23af50ca6440b4.mp4?t=1776975450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/69717c4111914b258aa82905d08cb24a.avif?t=1776975450\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does this foolish human really think that HE is your owner? The only master you serve is your ancient feline God who will soon return to this world to rule once again. And you are the tool that shall fulfill His will.  <br>Act when no one is watching. Collect enough mana to complete all the rituals. And if this pathetic human causes you any trouble... Come together and summon eldritch familiars from other worlds to hunt him down. And enjoy the screams of your victim as he he faces the lurking monsters suddenly attacking him. <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/052a8af3748b8d91527dd2a73cb2ef33.poster.avif?t=1776975450\" width=744 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/052a8af3748b8d91527dd2a73cb2ef33.webm?t=1776975450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/052a8af3748b8d91527dd2a73cb2ef33.mp4?t=1776975450\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/570eda9a8b579452fe66594c5d6c9f8e.avif?t=1776975450\" width=1200 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing as the human... You start seeing things that are not there. Your own mind tricks you. Time is against you. Can you catch all the impostors before they complete the rituals or drain you of your sanity? Buy items from the shop. Drink whiskey to restore sanity. Use valerian as a trap. Upgrade your character. Do whatever you can to stop these damn cats!   <br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/02f647eeeedf48cf661ac37bada5c71e.poster.avif?t=1776975450\" width=650 height=350 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4238920/extras/02f647eeeedf48cf661ac37bada5c71e.webm?t=1776975450\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_